        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_71519296b6ad498593f4f2701d66a411",
      "statement": "For a percentage deductible, the selected percentage is applied to the applicable limit for the damaged covered property rather than ordinarily to the repair estimate; covered-loss valuation and applicable policy terms are determined before the deductible is subtracted, and separate applicable limits are not combined solely to reduce it.",
